{"id": "Det9BRDR9Gc", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "How did Savitri win her husband back from YAMRAJ himself? With one wish he couldn't take back. 🙏\n\nNarad Muni warned Princess Savitri: Satyavan will die in ONE year. She married him anyway. On the last day, Yamraj came, pulled out Satyavan's soul (no bigger than a thumb!) with his noose and walked south. Savitri followed.\n\n\"Go back!\" he said. She kept walking and talking dharma. Impressed, Yama gave her boons, anything but Satyavan's life: her blind father-in-law's sight, his lost kingdom, 100 sons for her father… and 100 sons for HER, by Satyavan. \"Tathastu!\"\n\n\"You gave me 100 sons… and you're taking my husband?\" Yamraj laughed and set him free, with 400 more years together. (Mahabharata, Vana Parva)\n\nThat's why on Vat Savitri, wives still fast for their husbands.\n\n📚 15K FAMILY DEAL: Rishi Katha Books 1–3 for ₹350 (usually ₹500), extended till 25 Oct, midnight! Comment FAMILY and we'll DM you, or tap the link in bio → rishikatha.com\n\nIf Yamraj gave YOU one wish, what would you ask? Comment below 👇\nSave this for Vat Savitri, and share it with someone who never gives up 💛\n\n#savitri #satyavan #yamraj #vatsavitri #mahabharata #hindumythology #indianmythology #storiesforkids #hindustories #sanatandharma #rishikatha #indianmom #kidsbooks #mythologyreels #reelsindia", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1792503488, "like_count": 14092, "comment_count": 61, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-28813771134944385a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 55.467, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQO5Lb1aQ0uy-7VwZicNgxA-v_A8lp2k58t9GEFf61Vftprvi14EPAUSl3Wsp9FP7eBuvEFphKR6lfegZeD7sjQ17QJj58W0u6Ej4-E.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_oc=AdoJySkdSK59aSEtLcDHqoCJKTGsplQx